    {
      "id": "term-hau-t76",
      "termNumber": "76",
      "engSourceId": "eng-t76-v1",
      "title": "Jerusalem",
      "sourceFile": "eng/json/010.content.json",
      "selectedBy": "passage",
      "text": {
        "status": "absent",
        "fallback": "eng",
        "ai": true,
        "generator": "translation",
        "engSourceId": "eng-t76-v1",
        "html": "<p><b>Jerusalem</b> is the name of the most important city of the <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t77-v2\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">Jewish</data> people. The <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t138-v1\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">temple</data> of God, where the Jews <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t149-v1\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">worshiped</data> God, was in Jerusalem. The Jews traveled to Jerusalem several times a year to celebrate important festivals in the temple. The Jewish religious court, the <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t168-v1\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">Sanhedrin</data>, also gathered in Jerusalem.</p><p>About a thousand years before Jesus was born, king <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t33-v1\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">David</data> established the city of Jerusalem as the capital of <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t74-v2\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">Israel</data>. About 500 years later, the enemies of the <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t259-v2\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">Israelites</data> destroyed the city, but the Israelites built it up again. The Jewish people loved the city of Jerusalem very much.</p><p>Jerusalem was part of the province called <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"eng-t81-v2\" data-resource-code=\"FIAKeyTerms\">Judea</data>. Jerusalem was built on a hill. Therefore people always said they were going \"<em>up</em> to Jerusalem.\"</p>",
        "provenance": {
          "status": "missing"
        },
        "generatedFromSlot": "FIAKeyTerms@a39260670bba9d87d902e0fa0ae447341343481f:eng/json/010.content.json#eng-t76-v1"
      },
